WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.682
Views are useful security-adjacent interfaces but
they should not be described as secure or compliant

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:12.932
simply because they hide columns Permissions still
matter Row-level

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:20.500
security may matter Application access paths matter
Compliance

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:26.095
depends on a broader system of controls Keep the
claim proportional

00:00:26.121 --> 00:00:27.818
to what the view actually does
